{"unit_id": "Isanti2016__dsh-console#feature-1", "repo": "Isanti2016/dsh-console", "commit": "b137d5f67cf70bad2ddab28b3203f46852419e48", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-console 的功能「网页服务控制」：通过 `/web status|start|stop|restart` 查看网页服务状态或启动、停止、重启服务；启动时使用配置的 DSH CLI 入口和网页端口。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:73", "lib/backend.js:95-134"]}
{"unit_id": "Isanti2016__dsh-console#feature-2", "repo": "Isanti2016/dsh-console", "commit": "b137d5f67cf70bad2ddab28b3203f46852419e48", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-console 的功能「SSH 隧道管理」：通过 `/tunnel status|start|stop` 查看本地转发端口状态、启动 SSH 端口转发或停止隧道；将配置的本地端口转发到远端主机的服务端口。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:74", "lib/backend.js:139-185"]}
{"unit_id": "Isanti2016__dsh-console#caveat-1", "repo": "Isanti2016/dsh-console", "commit": "b137d5f67cf70bad2ddab28b3203f46852419e48", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-console 使用前须知：SSH 私钥路径可通过 tunnelKey 配置，并在启动隧道时作为 ssh 的 `-i` 参数传入；未配置时不传私钥参数（见 lib/backend.js:139-149）。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/backend.js:139-149"]}
